      "scope": "in_scope",
      "statement": "The kernels in \\eqref{eq:kernels} form a complete pseudo-Pick pair.\nTheir quotient is not positive semidefinite. No pair on a set with at\nmost two points can have these two properties when its source kernel\nis non-vanishing. Source rank two is minimal among finite-set examples.",
