      "scope": "in_scope",
      "statement": "Suppose the Pick matrix \\eqref{eq:pick} is positive for the source kernel\nin \\eqref{eq:kernels}. If real coefficients $a_1,\\ldots,a_n$ satisfy\n$\\sum_i a_i=\\sum_i a_i x_{z_i}=0$, then\n\\[\n \\sum_i a_iW_i=0,\\qquad \\sum_i a_i x_{z_i}W_i=0.\n\\]\nConsequently, repeated nodes have equal matrix values, and a datum\ncontaining all three distinct nodes has a single constant matrix value.",
      "status": "preparing",
