      "scope": "in_scope",
      "statement": "For $0\\leq t<5/99$, define\n\\[\n \\ell_t(i,j)=\\ell(i,j)+t\\delta_{ij}k(i,i).\n\\]\nThen $(k,\\ell_t)$ is complete pseudo-Pick, its target is positive\ndefinite, and its quotient is not positive. Each pair is not BLH,\nnot complete pseudo-Leech, and admits neither a weak nor a strong\nAgler decomposition.",
